<h1>Bio</h1>
<p class="lede">
  A few things that helped shape who I am today.
</p>

<ol class="bio-timeline">
  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="1979">1979</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>I was born on my mother's 30th birthday. What are the odds?</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Photo of me as a baby." aria-label="Photo of me as a baby."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="1985">1985</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>Growing up, my parents involved me in a lot of organized sports. I played a little of everything, but got a heavy dose of soccer and hockey.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Photo of me playing soccer as a kid." aria-label="Photo of me playing soccer as a kid."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="1994">1994</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>Early 90's rock. NY Rangers win The Stanley Cup. Street Fighter II. The early 90's were my favorite moment in pop culture.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="A Street Fighter 2 screen." aria-label="A Street Fighter 2 screen."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="1997">1997</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>I attended Marist College in NY. I began in Computer Science, but after a year of software programming I changed majors to graphics and design. I graduated in four years despite the switch.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Marist College rotunda." aria-label="Marist College rotunda."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2002">2002</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>I discovered CSS Zen Garden and taught myself advanced CSS. I started working more off hours and my job started to become a hobby.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Screenshot of CSS Zen Garden's first theme." aria-label="Screenshot of CSS Zen Garden's first theme."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2004">2004</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>I met a girl. One that makes me a better person and whom I consider my intellectual superior. Sara and I began dating.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Sara and Ted smiling." aria-label="Sara and Ted smiling."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2005">2005</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>Sara and I moved to Arizona and earned post-grad degrees. I (finally) learned to question tradition and everything in my life started falling into place.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Photo of Red Rock State Park in Sedona, Arizona." aria-label="Photo of Red Rock State Park in Sedona, Arizona."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2007">2007</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>I continued to grow as a designer / developer hybrid, but also got pretty good at designing and coding HTML emails. I also began tinkering with website performance.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Screenshot of email code in a code editor." aria-label="Screenshot of email code in a code editor."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2009">2009</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>After three years in Arizona, Sara and I moved back to New Jersey, bought a house, and tied the knot. My best friend is now my partner for life.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Sara and Ted's wedding." aria-label="Sara and Ted's wedding."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2010">2010</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>I landed a job as a designer at Canfield Scientific, a biotechnology & pharmaceutical company in New Jersey. I spent my days building web products in an industry that sorely needs thoughtful design.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Front of the Canfield Scientific building." aria-label="Front of the Canfield Scientific building."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2012">2012</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>Our first child, Sebastian, arrives! We're still getting the hang of the whole parenting thing…</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Photo of Sebastian as a baby." aria-label="Photo of Sebastian as a baby."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2015">2015</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>Wren, our second child, arrives just before year's end. We're now a family of four.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="My young family." aria-label="My young family."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2016">2016</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>I joined Stack Overflow's design team, where I work on products that help millions of developers worldwide while working remotely on a distributed product team.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Stack Overflow decorative graphic." aria-label="Stack Overflow decorative graphic."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2018">2018</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>Amidst my regular product work, I contributed to our design system and led the creation of one of the first email design systems.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Stack Overflow design system homepage." aria-label="Stack Overflow design system homepage."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2019">2019</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>I spoke at a few conferences, mentored a designer on my team, and leaned into the "leadership" part of my role.</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Me speaking at a conference." aria-label="Me speaking at a conference."></div>
    </section>
  </li>

  <li>
    <time class="timeline-year" datetime="2020">2020</time>
    <section class="timeline-body">
      <p>Joined Dialpad's design team</p>
      <div class="img-placeholder" data-placeholder="Dialpad logo." aria-label="Dialpad logo."></div>
